      ],
      "source": "https://www.wikixm.com/us/al/pinson/overview",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Turkey Creek Nature Preserve and the annual Alabama Butterbean Festival are key attractions in Pinson.",
